Charity data
------------
Nonprofit financial data is sourced from the IRS Form 990 via the ProPublica
Nonprofit Explorer API (https://projects.propublica.org/nonprofits/). IRS data
is in the public domain.

Billionaire data
----------------
Net worth figures are drawn from the Forbes Billionaires list and represent
point-in-time estimates. Forbes is the source of record; figures are used here
for commentary and criticism.

